        "quote": "(b) The temporary license issued under this section shall be effective for a period of up to 60 days and shall be subject to suspension or revocation for the same reasons as business licenses and employee, agent or guard licenses. A temporary license issued under this section may be extended for not more than two additional 60-day periods at the discretion of the Chief of Police. An application for a temporary license permit shall be accepted or rejected by the Police Department within one working day of the time it is submitted. (Ord. 20037 § 4, 12-6-16.)",
